  "prompt": "Create a transparent PNG game art experiment sheet for TinySeaWar, based on the supplied Warspite portrait for character identity only. Exactly TWO separate cutouts arranged in two widely separated columns with an empty transparent middle gutter: LEFT one full-body chibi shipgirl WITHOUT any ship/rig/weapons; RIGHT one separate simplified top-down naval rig WITHOUT any person. No labels or lettering. Character is super-deformed 2-head-tall, standing upright, huge blonde head, side braided bun, small blue-gold crown, blue eyes, white cape, navy royal dress with small burgundy accent and boots. Preserve these identity features but remove fine jewelry and uniform texture. Express calm veteran confidence. Simple clean cel shading, thick dark blue outer contour, large flat readable color shapes, only one shadow tone. Designed to remain clear when the person is 56 pixels tall; face and hair take half the height. Do not draw realistic detailed anime illustration. Right rig: compact stylized battleship naval-gray oval base, bow points RIGHT, four chunky twin-gun main turret shapes, no tiny secondary guns, no railing, no water or shadow. Low visual contrast relative to person. Both cutouts complete, separated, each fully surrounded by broad transparent padding. Left occupies left 40% of canvas, right occupies right 40%, middle20% blank. Do not attach rig to person. Genuine transparent background.",
